__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.venv/
venv/
.DS_Store
results/

# Not *.csv. The app ships four CSV files it cannot run without:
# data/library.csv, data/ecoli_codon_usage.csv, data/primers.csv and
# data/vhh_position_freq.csv. A blanket *.csv rule leaves the ones already
# tracked alone, which is why nothing broke, and silently refuses the next
# one you add. If you want to keep your own result tables out, put them in
# results/, which is ignored above.

# .streamlit/ is NOT ignored, deliberately. config.toml is what caps uploads
# at 20 MB on the deployed app, and what sets the theme; without it in the 
# repository, Community Cloud
# runs with its own defaults and the limit the manual quotes is true only on
# the machine the file happens to sit on.
